@host = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = relay_demo_key_change_me

### Service information
GET {{host}}/api/info

### Readiness
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Normal completion
POST {{host}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "model": "relay-fast",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Explain why idempotency matters in distributed systems." }
  ],
  "max_tokens": 180,
  "temperature": 0.2
}

### Force primary-provider failure and observe fallback
POST {{host}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "model": "relay-fast",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "[fail-primary] Explain circuit breakers." }
  ],
  "max_tokens": 120
}

### Stream completion
POST {{host}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "model": "relay-balanced",
  "stream": true,
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Stream a short explanation of provider failover." }
  ]
}

### Dashboard summary
GET {{host}}/admin/metrics/summary
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
